  "body_html": "<p>Embrace comfort and meaning with the Jeminise Personalized Tree of Life Quilt Set. Featuring the ancient Yggdrasil design, this quilt set symbolizes strength and interconnectedness, making it a perfect addition to your home or a thoughtful gift for your loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Amazing Yggdrasil Design:</strong> Showcases the beautiful Tree of Life, a symbol of resilience, strength, and family connections.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly fit your bed or suit various uses.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Professional Design:</strong> Crafted with specially designed colorful themes on a smooth material, offering both functional warmth and decorative appeal.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal and practical present for housewarmings, weddings, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, or any special occasion for family and friends.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for snuggling on the sofa, relaxing with a book, enjoying family time watching TV, or providing warmth during indoor and outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, dries quickly, and becomes fluffier after washing, ensuring convenient maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes with 1 quilt and an optional pillowcase to complete your bedding set.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Colorful Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw(60x70 inches)| Twin(68x86 inches)| Full(80x90 inches)| Queen (90x90 inches)| King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Machine Washable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
